[{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其七","author":"陆游","text":"粥香可爱贫方觉，睡味无穷老始知。\n要识放翁真受用，大冠长剑只成痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6339,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其十一","author":"陆游","text":"束书不观万事休，谁令识字惹闲愁。\n胸中作祟知何物，不是当年老督邮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6340,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"小诗苦思凭谁赏，绿酒盈尊每独倾。\n老境情悰例如此，不须惆怅感馀生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6341,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"穷销壮岁功名志，病过新秋赏咏时。\n自古世间如意少，天公宁肯为君私。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6342,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其九","author":"陆游","text":"八月吴中风露秋，子鹅可炙酒新篘。\n老人病愈乡闾喜，处处邀迎共献酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6343,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其十二","author":"陆游","text":"客疾无根莫浪忧，今朝扫尽不容留。\n饭囊酒瓮非吾事，只贮千岩万壑秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6344,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其十","author":"陆游","text":"清泉白米山家有，盐酪犹从小市求。\n寸步须扶本常事，细书妨读却闲愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6345,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"半饥半饱随时过，无客无书尽日闲。\n童子贪眠呼不省，狸奴恋暖去仍还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6346,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"今年病老遂难禁，二竖奔逃岂易寻。\n风雨三更僮仆睡，自持残烛检千金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6347,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其八","author":"陆游","text":"小诗闲淡如秋水，病后殊胜未病时。\n自剪矮笺誊断稿，不嫌墨浅字倾攲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6348,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉定己巳立秋得膈上疾近寒露乃小愈十二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"独立溪桥看落晖，残芜漠漠蝶飞飞。\n从来泽国秋常晚，叹息衰翁已衲衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6349,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰辛酉八月四日雨后殊凄冷新雁已至夜复风雨不止是岁八月一日白露二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"仲秋四日雁横天，闭户垂帷意已便。\n方叹今年时候早，夜深风雨更凄然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6350,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰辛酉八月四日雨后殊凄冷新雁已至夜复风雨不止是岁八月一日白露二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"残暑方炎忽痛摧，无情风雨亦奇哉。\n但嗟不为贫人计，未动秋砧雁已来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6351,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮春四首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"辛夷海棠俱作尘，鲚鱼莼菜亦尝新。\n一声布谷便无说，红药虽开不属春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6352,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮春四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"市桥岸下泛湖舟，雕槛疏帘半上钩。\n春事几何君惜醉，明朝赤帜插谯楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6353,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮春四首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"掠面微风吹宿酲，送春空有不胜情。\n风烟老尽王孙草，时听桑间小妇声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6354,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮春四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"祓除已过暮春初，彩舫相衔十里馀。\n浮蜡喜尝新店酒，流尘闲拂坏垣书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6355,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮秋六首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"百年大耋龙钟日，九月初寒惨淡天。\n岭谷高低明野火，村墟远近起炊烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6356,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮秋六首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"闲倾清圣浊贤酒，稳泛朝南暮北风。\n射的山前云几片，一秋不散伴渔翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6357,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮秋六首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"清秋又是一年新，满眼丹枫映白蘋。\n海内故人书断绝，汀洲鸥鹭却心亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6358,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮秋六首 其五","author":"陆游","text":"九月山村已骤寒，看云殊怯倚阑干。\n一杯浊酒栽培睡，不觉春雷起鼻端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6359,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮秋六首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"多雨今秋水渺然，沟溪无处不通船。\n山回忽得烟村路，始信桃源是地仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6360,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山园草木四绝句 其四 蓼花","author":"陆游","text":"十年诗酒客刀州，每为名花秉烛游。\n老作渔翁犹喜事，数枝红蓼醉清秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6361,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霁夜观月","author":"陆游","text":"云重真愁无散时，可怜不奈一风吹。\n清辉如此那休得，谁误虚空作许痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":6362,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲梅未开","author":"陆游","text":"梅蕊如红稻，中藏无尽香。\n何时来鼻境，更待几番霜。","